1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:01,920
I'm a wedding planner.

2
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:04,440
My job brings me a lot of pleasure.

3
00:00:04,770 --> 00:00:06,538
Today is an amazing day.

4
00:00:06,538 --> 00:00:08,970
I am planning my sisters wedding.

5
00:00:08,970 --> 00:00:11,770
She will wear a beautiful white dress.

6
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:14,080
I also get to wear a lovely dress.

7
00:00:14,550 --> 00:00:19,310
After the wedding, all the guests will have a nice dinner and will dance for hours.

8
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:24,310
In the evening, my sister and her new husband will cut a cake that I designed.

9
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:26,350
I hope they like it a lot.

